{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling world of treacherous dungeons, and endless combat! Knight of the Dungeon is a heart-pounding fusion of Rogue-Like and Bullet-Hell, with procedurally generated rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras/93de3a3d4b6c519f8886816994744b87.avif?t=1762406364\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Dungeons</strong> - Explore ever-changing levels filled with secrets. No two playthroughs will be the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Fight hordes of monsters and mighty bosses while dodging spaces. Reflexes and strategy are your best allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and loot </strong>- in each location you will find new weapons and magical artifacts that will change your style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Small inventory size\u00a0</strong>- you only have three slots. Use them wisely!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story shrouded in mystery </strong>- interact with mysterious NPCs and uncover the history of this dangerous world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for challenges and adventures, your journey begins right now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3648620/ae108711c80860136f230e04fc04e245951c9c56.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Vines","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3648620/9ad31a2a6ef6ad2130783f3fb5e1efde7d6c1527.jpg"},{"name":"Touch-me-not","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a